Description: FlickOS's mouse cursors
 Bibata Modern Classic in the sizes FlickOS shows, under its own name. Debian's
 bibata-cursor-theme is 178 MB of six themes in 14 sizes; this is one theme of
 5.5 MB, and both can be installed together.
